All four stages: exact ordered residual folds and dense concatenations.
Compact count 2474330 learned / 31304 moving scalars; 289 finite parameter-tensor gradients.
Final path widths R=[64, 128, 256, 512], D=[20, 48, 132, 160], joined=[84, 176, 388, 672]. Inference state remains unchanged.
